## Example Usage (GitHub SSO with Dex)

Configure a GitHub OAuth app with the callback URL `https://<kargo_hostname>/dex/callback`, and grant it access to your GitHub organization. Replace the team slugs in the example with your own teams. Run this example separately from the basic and exhaustive examples.

Supply `github_client_secret` through a sensitive variable, e.g. `TF_VAR_github_client_secret`. Terraform still stores this value in state, so protect access to your state backend.

